<title>USA: Independence Holding raises cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Independence Holding raises cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independence Holding Co on Thursday said it raised its annual cash dividend to $0.05 per share from $0.04 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable January 24 to shareholders of record January 10.</p>
<p>Separately, the insurance holding company said it completed the spin-off of its investment in Zimmerman Sign Co. IHC shareholders of record on December 20 received one Zimmerman common share for every five IHC shares.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders received a total of about 1.5 million Zimmerman common shares.</p>
</text>
